  "guide": {
    "by": "Written by your Hermes model",
    "guide": [
      {
        "text": "These sources are a season report, a council work session transcript and a survey about the Cedar Hollow Winter Warming Center.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P1",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“Cedar Hollow Winter Warming Center: Season Report, 2025-26”",
            "source_id": "s_86219c6face3"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Council work session",
            "locator": "[0:04]",
            "source_id": "s_03f99d14136e"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P11",
            "n": 3,
            "source_n": 3,
            "source": "Guest and volunteer survey",
            "locator": "para. 1",
            "source_id": "s_3c3ba36c8f50"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The center was open 87 nights and recorded 2,914 overnight stays by 412 different guests.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P2",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“What the center did”",
            "source_id": "s_86219c6face3"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The season cost $318,400, or $109 per overnight stay, paid by the city, a county grant and donations.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P4",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“What it cost”",
            "source_id": "s_86219c6face3"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Staff recommend opening earlier and adding an east side site, which would add $142,000 to the season's cost.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P6",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“Recommendations for next season”",
            "source_id": "s_86219c6face3"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P8",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Council work session",
            "locator": "[1:02]",
            "source_id": "s_03f99d14136e"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Of the guests surveyed, 74 percent said getting to the center was the hardest part, and 91 percent felt safe there.",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P13",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 3,
            "source": "Guest and volunteer survey",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_3c3ba36c8f50"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "asks": [],
    "questions": [
      {
        "text": "On January 21, 61 guests stayed in a hall set up for 60. Will a 35 degree trigger instead of 32 bring more guests than one site can hold?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P6",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“Recommendations for next season”",
            "source_id": "s_86219c6face3"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P7",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 2,
            "source": "Council work session",
            "locator": "[0:04]",
            "source_id": "s_03f99d14136e"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Guests asked for doors to open at 5 p.m. instead of 7 p.m. Overnight staff already cost $171,900. Who will staff the extra hours?",
        "chips": [
          {
            "ref": "P4",
            "n": 1,
            "source_n": 1,
            "source": "Warming center report",
            "locator": "“What it cost”",
            "source_id": "s_86219c6face3"
          },
          {
            "ref": "P13",
            "n": 2,
            "source_n": 3,
            "source": "Guest and volunteer survey",
            "locator": "para. 3",
            "source_id": "s_3c3ba36c8f50"
          }
        ],
        "suggestion": true
      }
